---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Notes Location">
  <h1>Notes location</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Writer is local-first. Notes are stored as real files on disk (not a proprietary database).
  </p>

  <h2>Default vault</h2>
  <p>
    By default, your notes root directory is:
  </p>
  <pre><code>~/Writer</code></pre>

  <h2>What’s inside</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><code>*.md</code> notes</li>
    <li><code>*.canvas</code> canvas files (JSON)</li>
    <li><code>image/</code> imported images (e.g. <code>~/Writer/image/...</code>)</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>

